Right.

274
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:28,080
I'm worried about Miss Freya, so I'm gonna go back.

275
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:31,080
Wait! I think I'll go with you.

276
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:33,080
Uzura, I'm leaving you to house it.

277
00:15:33,080 --> 00:15:35,080
Leave it to me, Uzura!

278
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:36,080
Let's go.

279
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:38,080
Great.

280
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,080
Adel?

281
00:15:39,080 --> 00:15:41,080
I don't get it, Uzura!

282
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,080
This is no good.

283
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:55,080
The dancing's fine, but their expressions don't work.

284
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:59,080
As it stands, there's no one who qualifies for winner or runner-up.

285
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:01,080
Next contestant.

286
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:13,080
What novel dancing.

287
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:15,080
Above all, she has great expressions.

288
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:17,080
Put her on the shortlist.

289
00:16:17,080 --> 00:16:18,080
Next, please.

290
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:32,080
Oh, it looks like a victory.

291
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:33,080
Has been decided.

292
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,080
Oh, no.

293
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:36,080
You mean the runner-up?

294
00:16:36,080 --> 00:16:37,080
Please make her the runner-up.

295
00:16:37,080 --> 00:16:39,080
Please make her the runner-up.

296
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:49,080
Very soon now, Father.

297
00:16:49,080 --> 00:16:51,080
What a lovely fragrance.

298
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:54,080
I can smell the sweet scent from here.

299
00:16:54,080 --> 00:16:57,080
I can hardly stand it.

300
00:16:57,080 --> 00:17:03,080
This time, I will most certainly bring to you a heart that shines blackly, Father.

301
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:08,080
And that will be the time when your efforts shall reap their reward, my daughter.

302
00:17:08,080 --> 00:17:10,080
Yes, dear Father.

303
00:17:10,080 --> 00:17:12,080
Leave Mewtwo to me.

304
00:17:12,080 --> 00:17:13,080
You need to save Freya.

305
00:17:13,080 --> 00:17:16,080
But if we just talk to Mewtwo…

306
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:18,080
You need to do as I tell you.

307
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:21,080
Alright.

308
00:17:24,080 --> 00:17:26,080
Blonde, she's the winner!

309
00:17:26,080 --> 00:17:27,080
Yes!

310
00:17:27,080 --> 00:17:29,080
Congratulations, Freya.

311
00:17:29,080 --> 00:17:31,080
My love belongs to you.

312
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:37,080
So, she really did win.

313
00:17:37,080 --> 00:17:39,080
Which means the runner-up!

314
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:44,080
Okay.

315
00:17:44,080 --> 00:17:47,080
Unfortunately, this year, no one called mine to runner-up.

316
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:49,080
And with that, I declare the competition over!

317
00:17:52,080 --> 00:17:53,080
It's over.

318
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:55,080
Oh, that's right!

319
00:17:55,080 --> 00:17:56,080
Hey!

320
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:58,080
Love only me, Freya.

321
00:17:58,080 --> 00:18:02,080
I want you to hate everybody else.

322
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:05,080
Your heart is young and beautiful, dyed black.

323
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:08,080
It gives off a strong fragrance.

324
00:18:09,080 --> 00:18:11,080
You'll give it to me, won't you?

325
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,080
I will.

326
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:14,080
Dance, Freya.

327
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:19,080
Dance is proof of your love for me, and give me your heart!

328
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:29,080
Miss Freya!

329
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:30,080
Miss Freya!

330
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:33,080
Back here!

331
00:18:47,080 --> 00:18:48,080
Wait.

332
00:18:49,080 --> 00:18:51,080
Please, come dance with me.

333
00:18:52,080 --> 00:18:53,080
Miss Freya.

334
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:54,080
Huh?

335
00:18:54,080 --> 00:18:55,080
Too...

336
00:18:58,080 --> 00:18:59,080
Quit showing your face.

337
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:01,080
Hurry and vanish.

338
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:02,080
Again?

339
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:04,080
You would try to come between Muto and me?

340
00:19:04,080 --> 00:19:05,080
I won't have it!

341
00:19:09,080 --> 00:19:10,080
Miss Freya!

342
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:11,080
Yes.

343
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:12,080
That's it, my little flower.

344
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:14,080
Come into my arms, Freya.

345
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:18,080
Pull yourself together, Muto!

346
00:19:19,080 --> 00:19:20,080
Miss Freya.

347
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:23,080
Is that love real?

348
00:19:23,080 --> 00:19:27,080
Weren't flowers your hope, your prayer, your wish?

349
00:19:28,080 --> 00:19:29,080
You're right.

350
00:19:29,080 --> 00:19:32,080
That is what I desire, what I pray for.

351
00:19:32,080 --> 00:19:33,080
Now look around.

352
00:19:33,080 --> 00:19:35,080
See how many have bloomed?

353
00:19:35,080 --> 00:19:38,080
Is this really what you wanted them to look like?

354
00:19:38,080 --> 00:19:41,080
Listen closely to the voices of the flowers you loved.

355
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:42,080
The flowers?

356
00:19:42,080 --> 00:19:43,080
Voices?

357
00:19:45,080 --> 00:19:46,080
I can't!

358
00:19:46,080 --> 00:19:47,080
I can't hear them!

359
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:48,080
Watch!

360
00:19:48,080 --> 00:19:49,080
Watch Tutu's dance!

361
00:19:49,080 --> 00:19:50,080
I can't hear them!

362
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:53,080
I can't hear the flowers' voices!

363
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:54,080
Don't give up.

364
00:19:55,080 --> 00:19:56,080
Remember.

365
00:19:57,080 --> 00:19:59,080
Remember your prayer.

366
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:09,080
My prayer!

367
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:10,080
Yes.

368
00:20:10,080 --> 00:20:12,080
Your prayer for everybody to be happy.

369
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:13,080
You need to be happy.

370
00:20:13,080 --> 00:20:17,080
That was what you wished for, wasn't it, Miss Freya?

371
00:20:22,080 --> 00:20:23,080
Oh, I hear them!

372
00:20:23,080 --> 00:20:25,080
The flowers' voices!

373
00:20:25,080 --> 00:20:26,080
Muto, remember!

374
00:20:26,080 --> 00:20:27,080
Why won't you love me?

375
00:20:27,080 --> 00:20:28,080
Fine!

376
00:20:28,080 --> 00:20:29,080
Muto!

377
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:30,080
Remember your real self!

378
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:31,080
My real self?

379
00:20:31,080 --> 00:20:32,080
Don't let your ears be poisoned by some knight too selfish to die.

380
00:20:32,080 --> 00:20:33,080
Grehi!

381
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:34,080
The way you are now is the real Muto.

382
00:20:34,080 --> 00:20:35,080
Grehi!

383
00:20:35,080 --> 00:20:36,080
What have you done to Muto?

384
00:20:36,080 --> 00:20:37,080
The one who made the prince like this is you, Tutu.

385
00:20:37,080 --> 00:20:38,080
Stop it!

386
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:43,080
After all, you returned the feeling of love to the prince, ignorant of the fact that it was

387
00:20:43,080 --> 00:20:44,080
dyed in the raven's blood.

388
00:20:45,080 --> 00:21:06,080
You didn't tell her, Fakir.

389
00:21:06,080 --> 00:21:07,080
I'm forever in your debt, Tutu!

390
00:21:07,080 --> 00:21:12,080
I'm forever in your debt, Tutu.

391
00:21:18,080 --> 00:21:19,080
Muto.

392
00:21:20,080 --> 00:21:24,080
Hey, are you angry with me because I kept it from you?

393
00:21:25,080 --> 00:21:26,080
A little.

394
00:21:27,080 --> 00:21:28,080
I'm sorry, Doc.

395
00:21:29,080 --> 00:21:31,080
Muto is Muto, right?

396
00:21:32,080 --> 00:21:36,080
Even with Raven's blood in him, Muto's Muto.

397
00:21:36,080 --> 00:21:39,080
He'll go back to his old self, right?

398
00:21:40,080 --> 00:21:41,080
Of course.

399
00:21:42,080 --> 00:21:43,080
Uzura's waiting for us.

400
00:21:43,080 --> 00:21:44,080
You be careful of Uzura.

401
00:21:45,080 --> 00:21:47,080
Congratulations, little Doc.

402
00:21:47,080 --> 00:21:50,080
Now there's one less thing you don't know.

403
00:21:50,080 --> 00:21:53,080
But perhaps ignorance was better.

404
00:23:25,321 --> 00:23:31,081
I am qualified to be a true prince, one who loves everyone, and is also loved by everyone.

405
00:23:31,081 --> 00:23:33,001
I already told you there is no Rue.

406
00:23:33,001 --> 00:23:37,401
That's not true. I don't believe that. I get this feeling you're still Rue.

407
00:23:37,401 --> 00:23:40,921
Promise to love only me, hate everyone else.

408
00:23:40,921 --> 00:23:44,681
When people say duck goes well together and is lovey-dovey, what's it mean, Sora?

409
00:23:44,681 --> 00:23:46,441
What duck is? With whom?

410
00:23:46,441 --> 00:23:49,081
A feeling expressed without even a word.

411
00:23:49,081 --> 00:23:50,841
That's the mime for I love you.

412
00:23:50,841 --> 00:23:56,521
All you children who love stories, come gather round.

